# Fear of the Dark (5/5): "Whenever this creature attacks, if defending player controls no Glimmer creatures, it gains menace and
# deathtouch until end of turn." Bot2 controls no creature, so the intervening "if" holds (CR 603.4) and the attacking Fear gets both
# keywords for the turn (CR 702.111, 702.2, 611.2a). It has neither before the attack, and neither once the turn is over.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fear of the Dark
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fear of the Dark.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fear of the Dark.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Attack(Fear of the Dark > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fear of the Dark.Keywords = Deathtouch; Menace
? Bot2.Life = 15
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fear of the Dark.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Life = 15
